5. Data Cleaning

The following preprocessing steps were performed:

Removed duplicate records.
Handled missing values.
Converted the date_added column into Date format.
Extracted:
Year Added
Month Added
Day Added
Standardized missing categorical values.
Verified data types.

These steps ensured that the dataset was suitable for analysis.

